  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of Regional Higher Education Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to support the GoM efforts to increase the access to quality of higher education system, diversify the supply of higher education and decentralize the institutions in charge of providing higher education within the country. More specifically, the project will promote higher education and increase the absorption capacity of the educational system through the establishment of new higher education institutions that respond to the growing number of students and provide qualified skills to the productive sectors of the economy. The project will foster development and improve competitiveness by training qualified human resources that can use science and technology to improve the productivity of the economy. It will support equipping students with the skills necessary to meet the demands of the job market. Through IAV, curricula development will comprise a module on entrepreneurship to equip the graduates with the required skills to create their own enterprise.</narrative>
  </description>
